import{_ as i,o,c as n,a2 as t}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 281 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Alaya Supervision Blank: The Universal-Benefit Version of \\"Imperial Power Does Not Reach the Countryside\\"","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 281 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Alaya Supervision Blank: The Universal-Benefit Version of \\"Imperial Power Does Not Reach the Countryside\\"","no":281,"module":2,"tags":["Tang-Luo","Alaya","Supervision Blank","Imperial Power Not Reaching Countryside","Myriad-Realms Benchmark"],"related":["21-Symbiotic Network Operating Principles","27-Anchor Calibration and Maintenance","29-Symbiosis Degree Evaluation System"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0281_模块2-唐罗-阿赖耶监管空白.md","filePath":"en/0281_模块2-唐罗-阿赖耶监管空白.md"}'),s={name:"en/0281_模块2-唐罗-阿赖耶监管空白.md"};function a(r,e,l,u,h,d){return o(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[t('<h1 id="entry-281-tang-luo-decomposition-alaya-supervision-blank-the-universal-benefit-version-of-imperial-power-does-not-reach-the-countryside" tabindex="-1">Entry 281 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Alaya Supervision Blank: The Universal-Benefit Version of &quot;Imperial Power Does Not Reach the Countryside&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-281-tang-luo-decomposition-alaya-supervision-blank-the-universal-benefit-version-of-imperial-power-does-not-reach-the-countryside" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 281 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Alaya Supervision Blank: The Universal-Benefit Version of &quot;Imperial Power Does Not Reach the Countryside&quot;&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Full Decomposition of the Tang-Luo System (Entry 31)</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-where-tang-luo-can-see-has-universal-benefit-what-about-where-he-cannot-see" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Where Tang Luo can see has universal benefit; what about where he cannot see <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-where-tang-luo-can-see-has-universal-benefit-what-about-where-he-cannot-see" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Where Tang Luo can see has universal benefit; what about where he cannot see&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the causal self-discipline axiom requires Alaya whole-network sharing; the collective ascension axiom requires no wasting big talent on small tasks. Tang Luo&#39;s universal benefit covers only places he can see — academy, cities, core disciples. Corners he cannot see: remote mountain villages, frontier tribes, underground dark markets, remain supervision blanks. This entry takes the law-first axiom as core. Protagonist uniqueness dependency judgment: <strong>Tang Luo = high dependency / bestowal-style civilization</strong>. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s evaluation base has been upgraded to six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Supervision-blank energy-level waste:</p><ul><li><strong>Monitoring blind spots</strong>: Tang Luo has no Alaya Network, his attention is finite. The world is vast, places he can see are under 10%. What happens in 90% of places, he does not know</li><li><strong>Feedback lag</strong>: problems in remote areas must report layer by layer to reach Tang Luo. During reporting, information is filtered, embellished, delayed. What Tang Luo sees is no longer the truth</li><li><strong>Calibration missing</strong>: because he cannot see grassroots, Tang Luo&#39;s good policies distort at grassroots. He thinks policies are effective, actually grassroots long ago changed policies beyond recognition</li></ul><p>Energy-level waste: <strong>Tang Luo&#39;s good will is discounted by his own attention boundary.</strong> What he can benefit is only what his sight reaches.</p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Grassroots distortion</strong>: good policies reach grassroots, twisted by local strongman interest groups. Tang Luo thinks universal benefit is delivered, actually grassroots commoners are still exploited</li><li><strong>Feedback failure</strong>: because information is filtered layer by layer, Tang Luo&#39;s perception of grassroots is severely distorted. He thinks the world is peaceful, actually undercurrents surge</li><li><strong>Blind spots become thieves</strong>: in supervision blanks, gray industries, underground forces, smuggling networks naturally grow. These forces after decades grow large, in turn erode universal-benefit results</li></ol><p>Regression form: the myth of &quot;peace under heaven&quot; under Tang Luo&#39;s rule is built on the suffering of the grassroots he cannot see.</p><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Blind spot is predation</strong>: places Tang Luo cannot see, predators run wild. His &quot;not managing&quot; is equivalent to acquiescing predation in those places</li><li><strong>Information monopoly</strong>: middle layers to protect themselves monopolize upward information flow. Tang Luo is deceived by his own subordinates without knowing</li><li><strong>Universal benefit&#39;s performativity</strong>: Tang Luo&#39;s universal benefit mainly occurs in &quot;places he can see&quot; — academy openings, disciples awarded, city tours. These performative universal benefits obscure grassroots real suffering</li></ul><p>By the Gu Chensha / Tang Luo judgment table standard: Tang Luo = <strong>enlightened predator</strong>, his predation form is &quot;supervision blind spots&quot; — he cannot see, so he is not responsible; but his not being responsible does not mean he has no responsibility.</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Tang-Luo Supervision Blank</th><th>Anchor Symbiosis Alaya Whole-Network</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Attention finite</td><td>Alaya Network covers every corner</td></tr><tr><td>Information filtered layer by layer</td><td>Information direct-connected, not through middle layers</td></tr><tr><td>Grassroots distortion</td><td>Anchor Supervision Committee sinks to grassroots, real-time monitoring</td></tr><tr><td>Blind spots become thieves</td><td>Supervision no dead angle, gray industries nowhere to hide</td></tr><tr><td>Feedback lag</td><td>Real-time feedback, deviation auto-alerts</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Alternative&#39;s crux: the Alaya Network is not to monitor commoners, but to let laws cover commoners. In the era when imperial power did not reach the countryside, Heng Yuan Zhou sends laws to the countryside.</p><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: replicate Tang-Luo attention distribution, marking supervision blanks</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: Group A attention supervision; Group B Alaya whole-network supervision</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: grassroots exploitation rate, gray-industry scale</li><li><strong>Review expectation</strong>: Group A grassroots exploitation rate long-term high, Group B approaches zero</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium-high</strong>. &quot;Sage lord cannot reach grassroots&quot; is real-world mapping</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: medium</strong>. Long-form late if it needs &quot;exposing grassroots truth&quot; to create turns, the early &quot;peace under heaven&quot; narrative is torn</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency</strong>: high</li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: good will discounted by attention boundary</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: blind spot is acquiesced predation</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo&#39;s universal benefit stops at his sight</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: Alaya Network covers 99%, including unseen corners</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: cross-plane supervision must rely on network, not on person walking</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="supplementary-discussion-legal-basis-for-sinking-supervision" tabindex="-1">Supplementary Discussion: Legal Basis for Sinking Supervision <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplementary-discussion-legal-basis-for-sinking-supervision" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplementary Discussion: Legal Basis for Sinking Supervision&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Tang-Luo system&#39;s Alaya supervision blank — the universal-benefit version of imperial power not reaching the countryside — means grassroots cultivators outside supervision are neither protected nor constrained. Heng Yuan Zhou through the Alaya Network&#39;s all-tier coverage solves this: from Sense Origin entry, the network builds a basic file for every cultivator. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s supervision is not spy-style monitoring, but a safety net under the law-first axiom — monitoring energy anomalies, early-warning karma risks, protecting weak ones from predation. The universal equal infinite law ensures supervision covers everyone, no one ignored for low status.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>&quot;Imperial power does not reach the countryside&quot; is the old era&#39;s helplessness. Tang Luo&#39;s universal benefit is essentially an enhanced version of &quot;imperial power reaching the countryside&quot; — he can go to more places, but still only places he can physically reach. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Alaya Network lets laws themselves go to the countryside, no sage lord&#39;s personal visit needed. This is universal benefit&#39;s true meaning.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./21-共生网络运作原理.html">21-Symbiotic Network Operating Principles</a> · <a href="./27-锚点校准与维护.html">27-Anchor Calibration and Maintenance</a> · <a href="./29-共生度评估体系.html">29-Symbiosis Degree Evaluation System</a></li></ul>',30)])])}const p=i(s,[["render",a]]);export{g as __pageData,p as default};
